  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you block a person (not hiding an avatar, but actually blocking a person), then change worlds twice so they're out of your recent avatar cache, then rejoin the world, wait for everyone to load in. Then unblock the person. Their name will appear but their avatar won't appear. You have to hide their avatar, then show them to get the avatar to load. They can't see you either. If you change avatars, then they can see you. If they change avatars you can see them.\nMy guess is that the unblocking system doesn't trigger some avatar load function that's needed. They are just completely invisible (not the blue loading avatar, completely invisible). You can talk to them and their name shows up. But their avatar doesn't load until you force an avatar load function to trigger.",
